    "why": "Every listed tag and script is handled in code. The one asymmetry is pi: it exists only in xacro_jade (math.__dict__ merged into the expression globals), which the xacro and xacro.py scripts load only when --inorder is passed; the legacy xacro module used by default has its own arithmetic lexer with no pi symbol, so ${pi} raises 'Property wasn't defined' under default processing. Whether that is a defect depends on how a consumer invokes xacro."
